      "status": "EDITORIAL_REVIEW_NOT_CORRECTION",
      "observation": "The original text associates HOW MANY with quantity singular and HOW MUCH with quantity plural in one line; conventional grammar distinguishes countable quantity from uncountable amount or price. Keep source unchanged pending explicit teaching decision."
